### Schedula REST Client API Specification File
@baseUrl = https://schedula-backend-45oj.onrender.com

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. User Signup (Doctor)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor.demo@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "DOCTOR"
}

### 3. User Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "doctor.demo@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 4. User Signup (Patient)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "patient.demo@hospital.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "role": "PATIENT"
}
